ng the character it would be helpful in case I want to use it for thumbnails for my twitch or YouTube broadcasts\n\n✦ Personality Aspects: She feels like a cold princess but reality is that she is just an anxious girl who feels she doesn't belong with human-folk. Once she gets out of her shell or gets to know you, she can be playful and like a teasing older sister to those around her.\n\n✦ Hair color: Black, underside is blue\n\n✦ Eye color: Reddish-pink with a darker purple at the top\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1azJuU3YJg7e9avpG5vlcchOgc4PPuqC1?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pizza_Apple014/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/18b5612e/uploads/origins/210d2ead-2e86-468e-aea4-61b130c70075?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36cbd56f4fef8c6670b4910d7c1b3cf8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/18b5612e/uploads/origins/210d2ead-2e86-468e-aea4-61b130c70075?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36cbd56f4fef8c6670b4910d7c1b3cf8, https://si.imgix.net/18b5612e/uploads/origins/210d2ead-2e86-468e-aea4-61b130c70075?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=093f3ed315ffb9421e491822b3088edd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/18b5612e/uploads/origins/210d2ead-2e86-468e-aea4-61b130c70075?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76af968279687298115b0f5c9666bd3d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のVtuberのキャラクターを描いてほしいです！描いていただいた画像はSNSに投稿させていただきます！アイコンにしたり、サムネイルにしたり、配信スケジュールに載せたりすることもあります！\n\nマフィアの家系で、銃を撃つのが得意。とても楽しくて元気な人です。趣味はゲームとお菓子🍡。\n\nヤンデレっぽく描いていただけませんか？サイズはできれば9:16でお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pizza_Apple014/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c5c77bf7/uploads/origins/86024d0f-de44-4abd-951f-f1c6d18a99eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c70f792b1565fdd82bae1be72e5e3fb8", "thum